<div class="graphics-article-title" >
  SS20 Outerwear
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text" style="padding-top: 10px;">
  <p>
    Drop 1 outerwear has you covered for whatever the spring/summer can throw at you. The Marsu Jacket is the more formidable all-weather jacket, while the Hooded UC is the more casual sportswear influenced popover with some hidden surprises.
  </p> 
</div>

<div class="max-width-1200" style="opacity: 1;">
    <img class="center-single ss16-preview" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/adsum-SS20-Product-Focus---Outerwear3001.jpg?v=1582755716">
    <div class="blog-img-caption">The Marsu Jacket - Available in Black and Sky Blue.</div>
</div>

<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    For the Marsu's exterior fabric, we bonded our own waterproof breathable three layer fabric using polytricot mesh, a 12K waterproof breathable membrane and a 100% nylon abrasion resistant face fabric. All three of the front pockets have large darts to add to their carrying capacity. The jacket is named “Marsu” because of its carrying capacity. Marsupial being the long form name of the jacket referencing animals that can carry their young around in their pouch. 
   </p> 
</div>

<div class="left-50" style="opacity: 1;">
  <div class="img-left-wrapper max-width-800">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/ss20-ecomm-drop-1-onmodel-1_98-223.jpg?v=1582823003" class="img-left ss16-preview">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="right-50 float-right" style="opacity: 1;">
